{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: RAG技术MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG 幻觉问题的类型与缓解策略\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG技术\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/RAG技术\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">RAG技术MOC</a></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n## 问题\n尽管 RAG 旨在减少幻觉，但幻觉问题仍然存在。RAG 中的幻觉有哪些类型？请提供系统性的缓解策略。\n\n## 答案\n\n**幻觉的两种类型：**\n\n| 类型 | 说明 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **内在幻觉** | 检索结果中有正确信息，但 LLM 生成的内容与检索结果矛盾 | 检索说\"准确率 91%\"，LLM 说\"准确率 95%\" |\n| **外在幻觉** | LLM 生成了检索结果中根本没有的内容 | 检索只提到 A，LLM 自己编了 B |\n\n**系统性缓解策略（六层防护）：**\n\n**第一层：Prompt 约束**\n\n```python\nSYSTEM_PROMPT = \"\"\"\n你是一个严格基于参考资料回答问题的助手。请遵守以下规则：\n1. 只能基于提供的参考资料回答问题\n2. 如果参考资料中没有相关信息，明确说\"我不知道\"，不要编造\n3. 回答时引用参考资料中的具体信息\n4. 不要添加参考资料之外的信息\n5. 如果不确定，请说\"无法确认\"\n\"\"\"\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>第二层：输出自校验（Self-Verification）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">VERIFICATION_PROMPT <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n请检查以下回答是否每一条都能在参考资料中找到依据。\n对于每条声明，标注：✅ 有依据 / ❌ 无依据 / ⚠️ 部分依据\n\n回答：{answer}\n参考资料：{context}\n\n输出格式：\n- 声明1：[依据状态] - 依据来源\n- 声明2：[依据状态] - 依据来源\n\"\"\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>第三层：引用标注</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">CITATION_PROMPT <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n回答时请标注每条信息的来源。\n格式：[信息内容](来源chunk编号)\n\"\"\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>第四层：温度调低</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 降低 temperature，减少随机性</span>\nllm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ChatOpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>temperature<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 甚至 0.0</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>第五层：检索-生成对齐检测</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">生成回答后，将回答与检索结果做相似度对比，如果回答中有大段内容和所有检索结果都不相关，大概率是幻觉。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">detect_hallucination</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> retrieved_docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> threshold<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检测回答中是否存在幻觉内容\"\"\"</span>\n    answer_embedding <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embed_query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    max_sim <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> doc <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> retrieved_docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        doc_embedding <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embed_query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>page_content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        sim <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> cosine_similarity<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>answer_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>doc_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        max_sim <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">max</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>max_sim<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> sim<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> max_sim <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> threshold  <span class=\"token comment\"># True 表示可能存在幻觉</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>第六层：兜底回答</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">generate_with_fallback</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> retrieved_docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> similarity_threshold<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"带兜底的生成函数\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 检查检索质量</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> retrieved_docs <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> max_scores <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> similarity_threshold<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"抱歉，未找到与您问题相关的信息。请尝试换种方式提问。\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 正常生成</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>retrieved_docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>完整防护架构：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│           幻觉防护六层架构                     │\n├──────────────┬───────────────────────────────┤\n│  事前预防     │ 1. Prompt 约束                 │\n│              │ 2. 高质量检索（混合检索+Rerank） │\n├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n│  事中控制     │ 3. 温度调低                    │\n│              │ 4. 引用标注                    │\n├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n│  事后检测     │ 5. 输出自校验                  │\n│              │ 6. 检索-生成对齐检测            │\n│              │ 7. 兜底回答                    │\n└──────────────┴───────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>效果量化：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略组合</th>\n<th>幻觉率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>无防护</td>\n<td>~30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompt 约束</td>\n<td>~20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompt + 温度调低</td>\n<td>~15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompt + 温度调低 + 自校验</td>\n<td>~8%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整六层防护</td>\n<td>~3-5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: RAG 本身就是为了减少幻觉，为什么还会有幻觉？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: RAG 只是提供了相关上下文，但 LLM 仍然可能：1) 忽略上下文，使用自身知识；2) 错误理解上下文；3) 当上下文不完整时编造信息填补空白。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: Self-RAG 如何解决幻觉问题？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: Self-RAG 通过在生成过程中引入反思令牌（ISREL, ISSUP, ISUSE），让模型在生成时自我检查是否有检索证据支持，从而主动抑制幻觉。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>认为 RAG 可以完全消除幻觉</strong> — RAG 只能显著降低，不能完全消除</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>只靠 Prompt 约束</strong> — 单一策略效果有限，需要多层防护</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>忽略检索质量</strong> — 如果检索到的文档本身就不相关，再好的生成策略也无法避免幻觉</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 data-heading=\"&lt;a id=&quot;q9&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Q9: ANN 近似最近邻搜索算法有哪些？HNSW 的原理是什么？\" dir=\"auto\"><a id=\"q9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"></a>Q9: ANN 近似最近邻搜索算法有哪些？HNSW 的原理是什么？</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"></code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>","headings":[]}